// nucleus_interface.phor — Trusted nucleus interface types
// Defines CPU entry points, trap leaves, mode transitions, interrupt dispatch
// Copyright (c) Phorensic OS — All capability-gated operations are audited
//
// Every kernel object carries:
//   data, identity, capabilities, provenance, residual history, trust state
//
// File: src/kernel/nucleus_interface.phor
